{
  "_meta": {
    "title": "Multi-shot: 9 camera views (Qwen-Image-Edit-2509 + Multiple-Angles LoRA)",
    "description": "Nine re-framings of one image in one prompt (Shots: establishing / wide / medium / close-up / over-the-shoulder / low / high / profile / detail; Zooms: extreme wide -> macro). LoadImage -> ImageScaleToTotalPixels (1MP, multiple of 16) -> VAEEncode (shared reference + start latent). UNETLoader qwen_image_edit_2509_fp8_e4m3fn -> Lightning 4-step LoRA -> Multiple-Angles LoRA (fal, trained on 2511; loads and steers 2509) -> ModelSamplingAuraFlow (shift 3) -> CFGNorm. Nine branches 100..180: TextEncodeQwenImageEditPlus (camera prompt, '<sks> <azimuth> <elevation> <distance>. <framing>') -> ReferenceLatent -> KSampler (4 steps, cfg 1, euler/simple) -> VAEDecode. Node 21 saves the nine views as one batch (shot order); node 20 saves a 3x3 contact sheet (each view at half size, ImageStitch rows then columns). The builder (src/lib/oj/multiShot.ts) sets the image, the nine prompts, seeds and filename prefix. Models: diffusion_models/qwen_image_edit_2509_fp8_e4m3fn.safetensors, loras/Qwen-Image-Edit-2509-Lightning-4steps-V1.0-bf16.safetensors, loras/qwen-image-edit-2511-multiple-angles-lora.safetensors (fal/Qwen-Image-Edit-2511-Multiple-Angles-LoRA), text_encoders/qwen_2.5_vl_7b_fp8_scaled.safetensors (CLIP type qwen_image), vae/qwen_image_vae.safetensors."
  },
